// The knight's snap flash (0.21.09, after feedback: no full-screen white-out). A bright core at the snapping
// fingertips plus a soft radial glow and ring that expand to ~1.75x the knight's height and fade to transparent as they
// grow (~1 s, ease-out), with a few sparkles riding the ring. Drawn on its own canvas: nothing dims the chat, never
// blocks input (pointer-events:none) and always leaves the DOM. One flash per 4 s at most (photosensitivity).
