/* bd-art.js v2 (Oct 2026): the Badger (key "badger") for the Delete animations, redrawn as a kindly OLD badger for
   feedback: grey-tinged muzzle and softer charcoal stripes, bushy white brows, a slight stoop (the head sits lower and
   further forward), a green cable-knit sweater with his rust waistcoat buttoned over it, thin round wire glasses with a
   lens glint, and a wooden walking cane in his far paw. 3/4 view facing the chat, warm key light from the upper left,
   cool rim on the far edge, ambient occlusion, layered fur strokes for texture. The string is the REST pose (also the
   picker mini and menu preview); bd-char.js poses each group.
   Hooks: .bd2-occ .bd2-root .bd2-rig .bd2-armF .bd2-cane .bd2-legF .bd2-tail .bd2-body .bd2-legN .bd2-head (.bd2-ear
   .bd2-lid .bd2-brow .bd2-nose .bd2-jaw .bd2-mouth .bd2-glint) .bd2-hold (.bd2-rc: takes the message colour; .bd2-paw:
   where the flying roll lands) .bd2-armN */
