// 0.22.1: SHARED SIDE / MIRROR FLAG for every delete character (fox, Treant, knight, and any new SNAP_SVG kind).
// showFigure(kind, side): side "left" (default; own messages, right column) or "right" (others' messages, left column),
// so the effect plays in front of the character, toward the message. For "right" the whole stage is placed at the
// right edge of the chat and mirrored with CSS (.snap-stage.snap-mirror { transform: scaleX(-1) }), which mirrors the
