/* 0.21.04: the backgrounds stay perfectly still when the keyboard or the emoji/GIF panel opens.
   The page wallpaper (body::before/::after) and the chat picture (#chat-bg::before) are anchored to the top and
   sized to the tallest the window has been at this width (--app-tall, --bg-h), so a shorter window (keyboard)
   or a shorter chat (panel) only hides more of their bottom; nothing rescales or moves. */
